            <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-en="2. Create" data-cn="2. 创作">2. Create</h3>
            <p style="color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5;" data-en="Tweak the sliders to find the perfect balance of petals and lines, or draw your own unique strokes with traditional ink colors." data-cn="调整滑块以找到花瓣和线条的完美平衡，或使用传统墨水颜色绘制您自己独特的笔触。">Tweak the sliders to find the perfect balance of petals and lines, or draw your own unique strokes with traditional ink colors.</p>
